{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/extras/bd72ccfd1c8407d4e8169efddb02c426.avif?t=1746536567\" width=630 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/extras/1ea01fd39642b8f1c2d0ba0c51867703.webp?t=1746536567\" width=620 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With great pomp and circumstance the Holdfast original soundtrack \u2018The Plight of War\u2019 presents to you a plethora of epic renditions of some all-time classics to uplift spirits and set the tone as you charge forward to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring iconic songs spanning from the Napoleonic Wars to The Great War this soundtrack brings forth not only 20 tracks (including instrumentals) but an entire music player available both in the main menu and in-game so that you\u2019ll never be without the choirs of war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an original soundtrack for Holdfast: Nations At War - A multiplayer first and third-person shooter set during the great Napoleonic Era and WW1. Charge into battle with over 150 players per server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/extras/7420dc69dde47bf2516d92b751df26e7.webp?t=1746536567\" width=620 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Unlock Holdfast's The Plight of War original soundtrack in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Unlock the Plight of War medal to display on your playercard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Unlock the Overture banner for your playercard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Unlock the Composer portrait for your playercard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Unlock the Maestro title for your playercard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Access to the original mastered soundtrack files in high quality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/extras/a0cfb0f8f8bce321cb98f6f17f93a9e4.webp?t=1746536567\" width=630 height=36 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2692500?t=1746536567","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2692500?t=1746536567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/223a5cc9591fb511edc30e75d8ecc2aa0c2757e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746536567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/223a5cc9591fb511edc30e75d8ecc2aa0c2757e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746536567","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/extras/bd72ccfd1c8407d4e8169efddb02c426.avif?t=1746536567\" width=630 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692500/extras/1ea01fd39642b8f1c2d0ba0c51867703.webp?t=1746536567\" width=620 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With great pomp and circumstance the Holdfast original soundtrack \u2018The Plight of War\u2019 presents to you a plethora of epic renditions of some all-time classics to uplift spirits and set the tone as you charge forward to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>